  "id": "citrus-tofu-udon-salad",
  "name": "Citrus Tofu Udon Salad",
  "subtitle": "Crisp tofu, fresh vegetables, and citrus dressing",
  "description": "A bright noodle salad combining pan-crisped tofu, crunchy vegetables, herbs, and a tangy soy-citrus dressing.",
